WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,360
I will also have a family today

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:09,630
Uncle Da Mao, Fifth Brother, Second Aunt, and Aunt Liu have something to do so late at night

3
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:15,750
Ah Tian, the child is so hungry that we can't help it.

4
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:18,310
I saw you sharing meat with everyone today

5
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:21,510
I knew you were kind-hearted, so I came here with shame.

6
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:24,910
The old Qin family bullied you before

7
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:26,310
We didn't dare to stand up

8
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:27,910
It's us who are shameless

9
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,630
But the child is hungry

10
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:32,030
I really can’t stand it when I’m a mother.

11
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:36,120
They also gave me some fair words before.

12
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:37,920
I remember that kindness

13
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:39,800
Everybody get up

14
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,200
What does kneeling sound like?

15
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,400
Come in and talk slowly

16
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:48,710
Take it back and hide it so you don't incur any trouble.

17
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:50,110
Fill the child’s stomach first

18
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:52,510
Oh my God, this is too much. How can we return it?

19
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:53,510
No need to pay back

20
00:00:53,510 --> 00:01:00,740
Separated and attached to each other, each other's accomplice A Tian
